@startuml 大学课堂抽象状态转换图

title 大学课堂抽象状态转换图

' 定义状态样式
state "课前准备\\n(Pre-class)" as PreClass
state "学生签到\\n(Attendance)" as Attendance
state "正式授课\\n(Lecturing)" as Lecturing
state "课间休息\\n(Break Time)" as BreakTime
state "异常处理\\n(Exception)" as Exception
state "暂停授课\\n(Paused)" as Paused
state "继续授课\\n(Continuing)" as Continuing
state "课堂讨论\\n(Discussion)" as Discussion
state "实验环节\\n(Lab Session)" as LabSession
state "作业布置\\n(Assignment)" as Assignment
state "答疑解惑\\n(Q&A Session)" as QASession
state "课堂测验\\n(Quiz/Test)" as Quiz
state "成果展示\\n(Presentation)" as Presentation
state "小组汇报\\n(Group Report)" as GroupReport
state "课程总结\\n(Summary)" as Summary
state "评估反馈\\n(Evaluation)" as Evaluation
state "正常结束\\n(Normal End)" as NormalEnd
state "延期完成\\n(Extended End)" as ExtendedEnd
state "未开始\\n(Not Started)" as NotStarted

' 基础流程
[*] --> NotStarted
NotStarted --> PreClass : 课程开始
PreClass --> Attendance : 准备就绪
Attendance --> Lecturing : 签到完成
Lecturing --> BreakTime : 课时过半\n/课间铃响
BreakTime --> Continuing : 休息结束

' 异常处理分支
PreClass --> Exception : 课程取消
Attendance --> Exception : 签到异常
Lecturing --> Exception : 紧急情况
Lecturing --> Paused : 突发事件
Paused --> Continuing : 问题解决
Exception --> NotStarted : 重新安排

' 授课中的分支活动
Lecturing --> Discussion : 组织讨论
Lecturing --> LabSession : 进入实验
Lecturing --> QASession : 集中答疑

' 讨论环节后续
Discussion --> Assignment : 讨论结束\n布置作业
Discussion --> Continuing : 继续讲课

' 实验环节后续
LabSession --> Assignment : 实验报告\n作为作业
LabSession --> Summary : 实验总结

' 答疑环节后续
QASession --> Continuing : 答疑完毕

' 作业相关分支
Assignment --> Quiz : 随堂测验
Assignment --> Presentation : 成果展示
Assignment --> Continuing : 简单任务

' 测验和展示后续
Quiz --> Summary : 测验完成
Presentation --> GroupReport : 小组汇报
GroupReport --> Summary : 汇报完成

' 总结和评估
Summary --> Evaluation : 内容总结完
Evaluation --> NormalEnd : 评估完成
Continuing --> NormalEnd : 正常完成教学

' 可能的延期情况
Exception --> ExtendedEnd : 无法及时解决
Paused --> ExtendedEnd : 长时间中断
Evaluation --> ExtendedEnd : 需要补充教学

NormalEnd --> [*]
ExtendedEnd --> [*]

' 添加注释说明
note right of PreClass
  教师备课
  设备调试
  资料准备
end note

note right of Lecturing
  知识点讲解
  PPT演示
  板书教学
end note

note right of Discussion
  师生问答
  观点交流
  思维碰撞
end note

note left of LabSession
  动手操作
  实践验证
  技能训练
end note

note bottom of Evaluation
  教学效果评价
  学生反馈收集
  改进建议制定
end note

@enduml